Cell["\<\
The string option \"StateFunction\" defaults to Total[Abs[#]^4]&, the inverse \
participation ratio of a normalized state.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->308083056,ExpressionUUID->"575589e2-3440-2a4f-881e-393a86e8c78e"],

Cell["\<\
\"StateFunction\" must be an anonymous Function or a nonempty list of \
anonymous functions; named functions do not match this option's \
implementation checks.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->1880867222,ExpressionUUID->"f7a458a2-04af-7648-834b-a75c85c7be09"],

Cell["\<\
With one state function, the output is grouped by sample and contains \
{energy, weight} pairs; with several functions, the output is grouped first \
by state function.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->1182766221,ExpressionUUID->"ca4d1e5a-2663-7a41-a4d7-8989ffebaca2"],

Cell["\<\
Omitting n requests the matrix dimension. Eigensystem options are filtered \
and passed through; the implementation supplies Method -> {\"Arnoldi\", \
\"MaxIterations\" -> Infinity}.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->200029420,ExpressionUUID->"153f0106-c60b-a149-a96c-62cc799de118"]
}, Closed]],

